<title>USA: MetroWest Bank increases dividend.</title>
<headline>MetroWest Bank increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MetroWest Bank said it increased its dividend to $0.03 per share from $0.025 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on March 14, to shareholders of record on February 28.</p>
</text>
